1
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:03,270
I'll answer one question on the border wall.

2
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:06,410
The border wall, the money was appropriated for the border wall.

3
00:00:06,410 --> 00:00:10,310
I tried to get them to reappropriate it, to redirect that money.

4
00:00:10,310 --> 00:00:11,550
They didn't. They wouldn't.

5
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:13,850
And in the meantime, there's nothing under the law

6
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:16,850
other than they have to use the money for what was appropriated.

7
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:18,030
I can't stop that.

8
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:20,030
Do you believe the border wall works?

9
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,030
No.

